elations Coordinator NFE03184P SDSU-Academic Affairs NFE 09/10/2026 South Dakota State University is currently seeking a Program and Tribal Relations Coordinator. In this position you will help support student success and be a collaborative team player. This position is located in Brookings, South Dakota. This position is a 12-month, full-time, benefits-eligible position.Must be authorized to work in the U.S. Sponsorship is not available for this position.KEY R... View Details Bookmark Help Desk Analyst CSA02802P BHSU-Network & Computer Support Services CSA Black Hills State University seeks applicants for a Help Desk Analyst in our Network and Computer Services department. This position serves as a key customer-facing member of the Information Technology team and requires exceptional customer service, communication, and problem-solving skills.RESPONSIBILITIES:- Manage university Help Desk operations and ensure faculty, staff, students, and other ... View Details Bookmark MBM Pillar 3 Director T00286P SSOM - Medical Education Temp The University of South Dakota Sanford School of Medicine is seeking a dedicated individual to be the Pillar 3 Director. This position coordinates curriculum and guides students in their academic programs. Pillar 3 occupies the final sixteen months of medical school when students complete required clerkships (sub-internship, emergency medicine, surgery sub-specialties, rural family medicine), e... View Details Bookmark Financial Aid Advisor NFE03182P BHSU-Financial Aid NFE Black Hills State University is seeking a dynamic, student-focused professional to join our Student Financial Aid Office as a Financial Aid Advisor. This position is an integral part of the Enrollment Management team and is based on the Spearfish campus. The Financial Aid Advisor serves as a key resource for students and families navigating the financial aid process. This position provides pers... View Details Bookmark Nutrition Aide CSA02799P USD-Head Start CSA USD Head