t of Dental Hygiene invites applications for a full-time (12-month, 100%) Clinical Faculty position based in Sioux Falls, South Dakota. This position is part of an innovative partnership between the University of South Dakota and Falls Community Health Dental Clinic that combines academic instruction, clinical supervision, and direct patient care in a com... View Details Bookmark Operations Coordinator CSA02798P USD-School of Business CSA The Beacom School of Business at The University of South Dakota is a vibrant, internationally accredited business school that has served students since 1927. It is the State’s flagship business school and a regional leader with consistently high national rankings.We are seeking a self-motivated, detail-oriented, and customer service-focused individual to provide support to the Prairie Family Bu... View Details Bookmark Assistant Director of Graduate and International Admissions NFE03179P SDSU-Grad & International Admissions NFE 09/10/2026 South Dakota State University (SDSU) is looking for a motivated and people-centered individual to help shape the future of enrollment as the Assistant Director of Graduate and International Admissions. This role will be critical in advancing the strategic enrollment management plan of the university as well as continuously helping to build the next generation of Jackrabbits. This is a 12-month,... View Details Bookmark Department Assistant (QE9678) CSA02796P Dean of Medical Student Affairs CSA The Office of Medical Student Affairs is a great place to make a difference!This student-centered department is seeking a highly motivated, detail oriented support person to join its close-knit team. The position will assist with managing the MSA office and providing administrative support to the Senior Academic Dean, Associate and Assistant Deans, the SSOM financial aid office and play a vital... View Details Bookmark Administrative Assistant, QE8701 CSA02797P Biomedical & Translational Sciences CSA The Division of Biomedical & Translational Sciences seeks a full-time, 12 month Administrative Assistant to provide customer service to faculty, staff, and students by supporting the academic, research, administrative and some financial functions of the Dean’s office. The successful candidate will be expected to assist in both administrative and financial needs specifically assisting with p... View Details Bookmark NSF NRT Project Coordinator CSA02790P SDSMT-Civil & Environmental Engineering 1 CSA LOCATION: Civil & Environmental EngineeringStarting Hourly Rate: Minimum of $19.27 per hour, depending upon education and experience, GFPOSITION PURPOSE:The Project Coordinator serves as the primary operational coordinator for projects including the South Dakota Mines’ NSF Research Traineeship (NRT) program, led through the 2D-Materials for Biofilm Engineering, Science, and Technology (2DBE... View Details Bookmark Selma Kendrick Assistant, Associate, or Full Professorship in Nursing F01880P SDSU-Graduate Nursing Faculty 09/09/2026 The endowment holder for the Selma Kendrick Endowed Professorship in Nursing in the SDState College of Nursing will partner with the college’s Native American Nursing Education Center with the goal of growing research and scholarly activities to impact the health of Native American Communities in South Dakota. The College of Nursing prides itself in commitment to excellence in education, resear... View Details Bookmark Associate Vice President for Human Resources NFE03162P NSU-Finance & Administration NFE Northern State University invites applications for the position of Associate Vice President for Human Resources, an exceptional opportunity for an experienced human resources professional to serve as the University’s chief HR officer. Reporting to the Vice President for Finance and Administration and the Board of Regents Chief HR Officer, the Associate Vice President for Human Resources provide... View Details Bookmark Senior Associate Athletic Director of Internal Operations NFE03171P SDSMT-Intercollegiate Athletics NFE Position Information:South Dakota Mines is seeking a confident, energetic, and highly organized servant leader to serve as Senior Associate Athletic Director of Internal Operations. This is a full-time, benefited position. Located in Rapid City, South Dakota Mines is an NCAA Division II institution and member of the Rocky Mountain Athletic Conference (RMAC). Hardrocker Athletics sponsors 13 NCA... View Details Bookmark Manager, Business Office NFE03177P USD-Business Office NFE The Manager, Business Office oversees student billing, receivables, loan processing, deposits, payment plans, collections, and customer service operations for the University of South Dakota. The position ensures compliance with Federal, State, BOR, and institutional policies; manages system processes and communication workflows; supervises Business Office staff; and serves as a primary point of... View Details Bookmark Department Head for Mathematics and Statistics and Professor F01929P SDSU-Mathematics & Statistics Faculty The Department of Mathematics and Statistics (Math & Stat) at South Dakota State University (SDSU) invites applicants for the Department Head and Professor position. We are looking for a dynamic and collaborative leader who is committed to providing a rigorous and practical educational experience with an emphasis on expanding federally funded research and graduate programs to support South ... View Details Bookmark Grounds Keeper CSA02792P BHSU-Buildings & Grounds CSA Black Hills State University is hiring a full-time Grounds Keeper to maintain the beauty and functionality of our Rapid City campus. This position plays a vital role in supporting a safe, sustainable, and inviting environment for students, faculty, staff, and visitors.DUTIES:Maintain lawns, nurseries, trees, flowers, shrubs, and irrigation systems.Care for streets, sidewalks, and related equipm... View Details Bookmark Cook CSA02795P SDSBV