      "description": "South Dakota Board of Regents Employment Opportunities | Search Jobs Skip to Main Content Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Job Alerts Log In /Create Account Help Search  Postings (134) Hide Search Options View all open Postings below, or enter search criteria to narrow your search. Keywords Posted Within Any time period Last Day Last Week Last Month Position Type No Selection NFE CSA Faculty Temp Position Title Institution No Selection Black Hills State University Board of Regents Dakota State University Northern State University SD School f/t Blind & VI SD Services f/t Deaf South Dakota Mines South Dakota State University The University of South Dakota Posting Number City No Selection Unspecified Aberdeen Alexandria Armour Belle Fourche Beresford Bison Britton Brookings Buffalo Burke Canton Chamberlain Clark Clear Lake Crow Creek Custer Dakota Valley De Smet Dupree Eagle Butte Elk Point Ellsworth Base Faulkton Flandreau Forestburg Fort Pierre Gettysburg Gregory Hayti Highmore Hot Springs Howard Huron Ipswich Kadoka Kennebec Lake Andes Lead Leola Lemmon Madison Martin Mc Intosh Milbank Miller Mission Mitchell Mound City Murdo Olivet Onida Parker Philip Pierre Pine Ridge Plankinton Porcupine Rapid City Redfield Salem Selby Sioux Falls Sisseton Spearfish Sturgis Tea Timber Lake Tyndall Vermillion Watertown Webster Wessington Springs White River Winner Woonsocket Yankton Previous 1 2 3 4 5 Next View Results (134\n    ) Job Title Posting Number Department Position Type Job Close Date IT Engineer CSA02794P USD-VP for Admin & Technology CSA USD is seeking an IT Engineer to provide support to install, program, test, and maintain infrastructure systems at the University of South Dakota. The successful candidate will support hardware and software needs for the campus, work with vendors to specify hardware and software solutions and recommend enhancements to campus infrastructure and resources. This position includes on-call responsib... View Details Bookmark Building Maintenance Specialist - HVAC CSA02698P DSU-Physical Plant - Facilities Mgmt CSA Dakota State University is seeking applications for a full-time Building Maintenance Specialist – HVAC. This position is responsible for maintaining existing plumbing, heating and cooling systems on the facilities and installing new systems according to state code. The position will report to the Assistant Director of Facilities Trades. Responsibilities:Create estimates for new installations of... View Details Bookmark Director of Community Relations NFE03172P USD-Presidents Office NFE The Director of Community Relations serves as the University of South Dakota’s primary relationship-builder and institutional ambassador in the Sioux Falls metropolitan area. Based at USD-Sioux Falls, this position advances the university’s visibility, reputation and strategic engagement by cultivating partnerships with businesses, employers, community organizations, professional associations a... View Details Bookmark Assistant Professor of Interior Design F01875P SDSU-School of Design Faculty 09/21/2026 Bring your creative vision and design expertise to South Dakota State University! The School of Design invites applications for an Assistant Professor of Interior Design. We are seeking a collaborative educator with a strong foundation in interior design or interior architecture and specialized expertise in one or more content areas such as materials, computer aided design software (Revit, Sket... View Details Bookmark South Dakota Mesonet Instrumentation Technician NFE03170P SDSU-Ag & Biosystems Engineering NFE 09/10/2026 South Dakota State University (SDState) is seeking two individuals to support the South Dakota Mesonet, South Dakota State University’s statewide network of weather stations. This position travels throughout the state to install and maintain weather stations as well as working in the lab to assemble, calibrate, and test components. Stations are relied on by the National Weather Service for the ... View Details Bookmark Advisor-Academics NFE03164P SDSU-Undergraduate Nursing NFE South Dakota State University’s College of Nursing is seeking an Academic Advisor who is passionate about student growth and success. This role offers the opportunity to build meaningful connections with students while contributing to a collaborative and supportive academic environment. This position is located in Brookings, South Dakota and is a 12-month, full-time, benefits-eligible position.... View Details Bookmark Assistant, Associate or Full Professor of Veterinary Immunology F01904P SDSU-Veterinary & Biomedical Sciences Faculty 09/10/2026 South Dakota State University (SDSU) Department of Veterinary and Biomedical Sciences is seeking applications for a tenure track veterinary immunologist at the Assistant, Associate or Full Professor level. We are seeking an innovative educator and scientist with a research focus on mammalian food-animal infectious disease and immunological responses which will complement and enhance the current... View Details Bookmark Department Head of Electrical Engineering & Computer Science and Professor F01922P SDSU-Electrical Engr & Computer Science Faculty The McComish Department of Electrical Engineering and Computer Science (EECS) at South Dakota State University (SDSU) is seeking dynamic and collaborative leader to serve as the Department Head at the rank of Professor. Depending on the selected candidate’s area of expertise, faculty endowment may also be available. We are looking for a leader who is committed to providing a rigorous and practi... View Details Bookmark Assistant Dean for Academic Programs NFE03167P SDSU-Ag, Food & Environmental Sciences NFE 09/08/2026 South Dakota State University is seeking an Assistant Dean for Academic Programs with the College of Agriculture, Food and Environmental Sciences. This position will manage college-level activities related to student success in the College of Agriculture, Food and Environmental Sciences (CAFES) including Scholarships, Career Fair, New Student Orientation, Academic Advising, and student engageme... View Details Bookmark Adjunct, Biology F01935P BHSU-School of Natural Sciences Faculty Black Hills State University invites applicants for an adjunct instructor in Biology to teach Survey of Biology I and II courses on the Spearfish campus. Successful candidates must possess at least an MS in Biology or related discipline, and teaching experience in higher education is preferred.Applications may be made online at https://yourfuture.sdbor.edu. Interested individuals should complet... View Details Bookmark Dean, Beacom School of Business NFE03161P USD-School of Business NFE The University of South Dakota (USD) invites applications for the next Dean of the Beacom School of Business, a pivotal academic leader who will shape the future of business education across South Dakota and the region.The successful candidate will be an entrepreneurial, innovative visionary who values all Beacom programs, students, faculty, and staff — and who celebrates their successes. The n... View Details Bookmark Grounds Crew Specialist CSA02772P SDSMT-Facilities Management CSA LOCATION: Facilities and Risk ManagementStarting Hourly Rate: Minimum of $18.45 per hour, depending upon education and experience, GEPOSITION PURPOSE: Will serve as a specialist in grounds care and maintenance. Duties include safely operating various types of grounds equipment; care of landscape and grounds, including snow removal, garbage pick-up, mowing, watering, cultivating, spraying, ferti... View Details Bookmark Advisor - Student Success NFE03163P SDSU-International Student & Schol Engment NFE 09/07/2026 If you have a passion for helping students succeed, South Dakota State University has an opportunity for you. The Office of International Student and Scholar Engagement is looking for an Advisor for Student Succes dedicated to serving students with an emphasis on the international student population. The ideal candidate will guide students through ongoing maintenance of legal status, assist in ... View Details Bookmark Pre-School Teacher NFE03159P USD-Head Start NFE USD Head Start is seeking a passionate and dedicated Center Teacher to join our preschool team in Vermillion, SD.In this role, you’ll guide a classroom of 16 children ages 3–5, helping them build the social, emotional, and early academic skills that set the foundation for lifelong learning.What You’ll DoLead a preschool classroom of 16 childrenCreate a nurturing, developmentally appropriate lea... View Details Bookmark Grant Specialist I CSA02777P SDSMT-Sponsored Programs CSA LOCATION: Office of Sponsored ProgramsSTARTING HOURLY RATE: Minimum of $28.54 per hour, depending upon education and experience, GJPOSITION PURPOSE: Monitoring compliance with applicable laws and rules and accounting and reporting systems. Creation/preparation of subaward documents and reverse contract for services, including completion of forms, certification requirements, interpretation of gu... View Details Bookmark Grant Specialist I CSA02776P SDSMT-Sponsored Programs CSA LOCATION: Office of Sponsored ProgramsStarting Hourly Rate: Minimum of $28.54 per hour, depending upon education and experience, GJPOSITION PURPOSE: Prepare and submit external invoices, financial reports and document cost share per award terms and conditions. Complete reports and ad-hoc requests from internal and external customers. Reviews expenditures for adherence to Federal regulations, ag... View Details Bookmark Faculty, QE9811 (Physiology) F01932P Biomedical & Translational Sciences Faculty The Division of Biomedical and Translational Sciences at the University of South Dakota Sanford School of Medicine invites applications for an Academic Biomedical Science Educator to teach Human Medical Physiology. This is a 12-month position, tenure track. Degree requirement: Ph.D. in Medical Physiology or closely related field OR Professional Degree at the doctoral level in the healthcare fie... View Details Bookmark Precision Livestock Extension Field Specialist I NFE03157P SDSU-Agriculture Program-Ext NFE 09/15/2026 The Agriculture Program with South Dakota State University Extension is seeking a Precision Livestock Extension Field Specialist I to provide strong statewide leadership, within their capstone area of specialization, in delivering research-based information, resources, programming, and support via learning communities while building relationships with stakeholder groups to support the vision of... View Details Bookmark Senior Accountant CSA02782P BHSU-Administrative Services CSA Black Hills State University seeks applicants to fill an Senior Accountant position.DUTIES:Acts as a paraprofessional to accounting and fiscal professionals by performing assigned accounting practices to assist with fundamental accounting and routine fiscal procedures. This position will assist bank reconciliations, general ledger entries, department billing along with other duties as assigned.... View Details Bookmark Controller NFE03119P SDSU-Accounting Office-Controller NFE South Dakota State University (SDSU) is seeking a driven and visionary Controller to join the Accounting Department in a vital leadership role. This position not only offers the opportunity to make a significant impact on the university’s financial strategy but also provides a clear pathway for professional growth and further leadership opportunities within our dynamic team. This position is lo... View Details Bookmark Construction Project Manager NFE03154P USD-Planning and Construction NFE The individual will need experience managing construction projects of all sizes and scope. They will be responsible for client satisfaction, contract management, billing, design, construction administration, and project closeout. This position will complete project management from start to end and will be responsible for coordinating with campus 