rvices via phone, remote, and... View Details Bookmark Nutrition Aide CSA02676P USD-Head Start CSA USD Head Start is seeking a Nutrition Aide for the Head Start classroom in Beresford. This position is a part-time position. The position works from Mid-August until End of May annually.Responsibilities include serving breakfast and/or lunch and preparing and serving snack for children ages 3-5 attending a Head Start classroom.Prefer applicant that has experience with food service and with chil... View Details Bookmark Adjunct University Supervisor for Field Experiences T00267P NSU-Education General Temp Responsibilities: Northern State University invites applications for an Adjunct University Supervisor to support clinical field experiences within the teacher preparation programs. The successful candidate will be responsible for supervising undergraduate teacher candidates, collaborating with cooperating teachers and candidates at multiple points throughout the field experience, and completing... View Details Bookmark Instructor, Lecturer, or Senior Lecturer of Mechanical Engineering F01914P SDSMT-Leslie A. Rose Department of Mechanical Engineering Faculty The Department of Mechanical Engineering at the South Dakota School of Mines & Technology invites applications for fall 2026 and/or spring 2027 semester Instructor, Lecturer, or Senior Lecturer positions. These are part-time, temporary, non-benefited positions and may continue semester-by-semester, dependent upon performance, department need, funding, and student enrollment.Expectations wil... View Details Bookmark Assistant Professor of Business Analytics and Information Systems F01926P NSU-Management Information Systems Faculty Northern State University’s School of Business is accepting applications for a tenure-track Assistant Professor of Business Analytics. The successful candidate will support the School’s newly established Analytics major and contribute to the School’s existing Information Systems major. *Qua