ract often with students, alum, and the community including frequent contac... View Details Bookmark Custodial Operations Specialist CSA02753P USD-Intercollegiate Athletics CSA Duties include: Performs routine event set-ups and custodial duties to ensure areas within the Athletic Department are prepared for both athletic and outside events and the facilities are well maintained. Must be able to work in a team environment with different individuals. This is a fast paced environment with a need for proactive attitude and good customer service skills. Must possess knowle... View Details Bookmark Department Head & Professor F01869P SDSU-Construction & Concrete Industry Management Faculty The Department of Construction and Concrete Industry Management at South Dakota State University (SDState) invites applicants for the position of Professor and Department Head. We seek an innovative leader to advance academic programs, grow funded research, and strengthen outreach to stakeholders in the state and region. The individual selected for this role will work with the Dean and the lead... View Details Bookmark Adjunct Instructor - Physics F01919P BHSU-School of Natural Sciences Faculty Black Hills State University invites applicants for an adjunct instructor in Physics to teach Introduction to Physics I and II courses online. Successful candidates must possess at least an MS in Physics or related discipline, and teaching experience in higher education is preferred.Applications may be made online at https://yourfuture.sdbor.edu. Interested individuals should complete an online... View Details Bookmark Vice President for Institutional Advancement NFE03101P DSU-President NFE Dakota State University (DSU) invites applications and nominations for the position of Vice President for Institutional Advancement and President/CEO of the Dakota State University Foundation. Reporting to the Foundation Board of Trustees and serving as a member of the DSU President’s Cabinet, the Vice President provides strategic leadership for the university’s comprehensive advancement progra... View Details Bookmark Assistant Director, Facilities Planning and Management NFE03102P BHSU-Facility Services NFE Black Hills State University invites qualified, self-motivated candidates to apply for the position of Assistant Director, Facilities Planning and Management within the Facilities Services Department.The Assistant Director of Facilities Planning and Management provides leadership and oversight for campus facilities operations, maintenance, planning, sustainability, and capital projects. This po... View Details Bookmark Mechanical Engineer NFE03112P SDSU-Facilities & Services-Energy Systems NFE South Dakota State University (SDState) – Facilities & Services is looking for a Mechanical Engineer to support the operation, maintenance, and repair of the Animal Resource Wing (ARW) and other campus buildings. In this role, you’ll manage facility maintenance, oversee repairs and alterations, and contribute to mechanical project planning and design across campus. This position will help e... View Details Bookmark Coordinator of Native Student Services NFE03084P USD-Student Services NFE The University of South Dakota is seeking to fill the position, Coordinator of Native Student Services. This position will work under the direct supervision of the Director of Native Student Services (NSS) and will support efforts focused on students enrolled or eligible for enrollment with a federally-recognized tribe with a federally recognized Indian tribe or who may be eligible for enrollme... View Details Bookmark Postdoctoral Researcher, QE9076 NFE03107P Biomedical & Translational Sciences NFE The Chen Lab in the Division of Biomedical and Translational Sciences (BaTS) at the University of South Dakota (USD) Sanford School of Medicine (SSOM) invites applications for a Postdoctoral Fellow position in the field of Cardiovascular Regenerative Engineering, Medicine, and Technology, with a tr