t & Schol Engment NFE 09/07/2026 If you have a passion for helping students succeed, South Dakota State University has an opportunity for you. The Office of International Student and Scholar Engagement is looking for an Advisor for Student Succes dedicated to serving students with an emphasis on the international student population. The ideal candidate will guide students through ongoing maintenance of legal status, assist in ... View Details Bookmark Advisor-Academics NFE03164P SDSU-Undergraduate Nursing NFE South Dakota State University’s College of Nursing is seeking an Academic Advisor who is passionate about student growth and success. This role offers the opportunity to build meaningful connections with students while contributing to a collaborative and supportive academic environment. This position is located in Brookings, South Dakota and is a 12-month, full-time, benefits-eligible position.... View Details Bookmark Alumni Relations Officer NFE03105P DSU-Institutional Advancement NFE Dakota State University is seeking an enthusiastic and creative Alumni Relations Officer to join our team. This is an excellent role for a professional who is ready to make an impact by supporting alumni engagement and strengthening lifelong relationships between graduates and DSU. Responsibilities:Develop, plan, and implement engaging alumni events and programs that connect former students wit... View Details Bookmark Assistant Athletic Trainer NFE03190P SDSU-Intercollegiate Athletics NFE South Dakota State University (SDState) is seeking an Assistant Athletic Trainer to join our team. This role supports the coordination of athletic training services, ensuring the health and well-being of our student-athletes. From injury prevention and evaluation to rehabilitation and return-to-play management, this position plays a vital role in keeping athletes performing at their best. We’re... View Details Bookmark Assistant Coach, Triathlon NFE03188P BHSU-Intercolleg Athletics NFE Black H