d customer service skills. Must possess knowle... View Details Bookmark Senior Secretary CSA02754P USD-School of Law CSA The University of South Dakota School of Law invites applications for a Senior Secretary. This is a 12-month, Civil Service, regular position eligible for state benefits.This position will serve in an administrative support capacity for law school faculty members and other Law School staff, as needed. They will also interact often with students, alum, and the community including frequent contac... View Details Bookmark Facility Worker CSA02755P SDSMT-Facilities Management CSA LOCATION: Facilities ManagementStarting Hourly Rate: $17.10 + per hour, depending upon education and experience, GCPOSITION PURPOSE: Performs a variety of cleaning and maintenance procedures to ensure sanitary conditions are met. Duties will include maintaining hard surface floors, including sweeping, mopping, and refinishing; maintaining carpets, including vacuuming and shampooing; cleaning an... View Details Bookmark Program Assistant I CSA02762P SDSMT-Karen M. Swindler Chemical and Biological Engineering CSA LOCATION: Karen M. Swindler Department of Chemical and Biological EngineeringSTARTING HOURLY RATE: Minimum rate of $21.41 hourly, depending upon education and experience, GGPOSITION PURPOSE: The Karen M. Swindler Department of Chemical and Biological Engineering (CBE) at South Dakota Mines is seeking applicants for Program Assistant I. This position will provide professional and efficient admin... View Details Bookmark Support Services Analyst CSA02767P USD - Information Technology Services CSA The University of South Dakota is seeking an energetic and motivated Support Services Analyst to join the Information Technology Services team, providing exceptional IT support services to faculty, staff, and students. Candidate will be a member of the Service Desk team and located at the USD Vermillion SD campus. Candidate is responsible for customer support and services via ph