kmark Operations Coordinator CSA02798P USD-School of Business CSA The Beacom School of Business at The University of South Dakota is a vibrant, internationally accredited business school that has served students since 1927. It is the State’s flagship business school and a regional leader with consistently high national rankings.We are seeking a self-motivated, detail-oriented, and customer service-focused individual to provide support to the Prairie Family Bu... View Details Bookmark Program Assistant I CSA02771P SDSU-Undergraduate Nursing CSA 09/22/2026 Join the college of Nursing as a Program Assistant I and become an essential member of our Undergraduate Nursing team. We’re seeking a detail oriented and service focused professional who enjoys supporting students, faculty, and staff while helping ensure the smooth operation of our academic programs. This position is located in Rapid City, South Dakota.The College of Nursing has a long history... View Details Bookmark Part-Time Digital Accessibility Specialist CSA02770P DSU-Information Technology Services CSA Dakota State University is seeking a temporary, part-time Digital Accessibility Specialist to support campus-wide accessibility initiatives. This position plays an important role in helping ensure that digital content is accessible to all users while supporting faculty, staff, and students in creating inclusive learning and working environments.Key ResponsibilitiesAssist with training and suppo... View Details Bookmark Accounting Assistant CSA02800P USD - Enrollment Management CSA The University of South Dakota is seeking a detail-oriented and customer-focused Accounting Assistant to support the Enrollment Management organization. This position plays a critical role in ensuring the timely and accurate processing of financial transactions while providing exceptional service to faculty, staff, students, and external partners.The Accounting Assistant serves as a key resourc... View Details Bookmark Information Specialist CSA02815P SDSU- Animal Science CSA 09/18/2026 South Dakota State University (SDState) is currently seeking an Information Specialist to join our Animal Science department. This position will play a critical role in the department’s three primary missions which are learning, discovery, and engagement. If you have a strong attention to detail and excellent writing, editing and proofreading skills then this position may be for you!Tomorrow’s ... View Details Bookmark Program Assistant I, University Libraries CSA02775P USD-Libraries CSA The University Libraries seeks a motivated, communicative and well-organized team member to advance the libraries’ support for the mission of the University of South Dakota.The successful individual will have knowledge and experience with, or will readily learn USD and SDBOR Human Resources and Payroll systems, policies and procedures; demonstrate a record of excellent interpersonal skills; dem... View Details Bookmark Help Desk Analyst CSA02802P BHSU-Network & Computer Support Services CSA Black Hills State University seeks applicants for a Help Desk Analyst in our Network and Computer Services department. This position serves as a key customer-facing member of the Information Technology team and requires exceptional customer service, communication, and problem-solving skills.RESPONSIBILITIES:- Manage university Help Desk operations and ensure faculty, staff, students, and other ... View Details Bookmark Outreach & Event Coordinator CSA02785P SDSMT-Marketing & Communications CSA LOCATION: Marketing & CommunicationsSTARTING HOURLY RATE: $21.41-$23.99 hourly, depending upon education and experience, GGPosition Summary:Support South Dakota Mines’ public image and K-12 education pipeline by planning and executing public relations and K-12-focused events, and by developing community and K-12 outreach efforts that connect prospective students with Mines resources.Duties ... View Details Bookmark Senior Accountant CSA02782P BHSU-Administrative Services CSA Black Hills State University seeks applicants to fill an Senior Accountant position.DUTIES:Acts as a paraprofessional to accounting and fiscal professionals by performing assigned accounting practices to assist with fundamental accounting and routine fiscal procedures. This position will assist bank reconciliations, general ledger entries, department billing along with other duties as assigned.... View Details Bookmark Previous 1 2 3 4 5 Next The South Dakota Board of Regents is an Equal Opportunity Employer. The Board of Regents will take Affirmative Action to ensure that all employment practices are free of discrimination. In addition, the Board of Regents fully supports incorporation of non-discrimination and Affirmative Action rules and regulations into all of its employment practices. Arrangements for accommodations required by disabilities can be made by contacting the appropriate Human Resources office. Please see the Contact Us section of this webpage for more information. Veterans’ & Disability Preference/Re-employment Rights Campus Security & Crime Statistics Clery Report Position Definitions Notice to all applicants: If you are selected as a finalist, job references and a background check may be conducted. South Dakota Board of Regents 306 E. Capital Ave, Suite 200 Pierre, SD 57501 605-773-3455 Back to top Copyright © Faber To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
