Bookmark Assistant Coach, Triathlon NFE03188P BHSU-Intercolleg Athletics NFE Black Hills State University is seeking applicants for an Assistant Triathlon Coach in the Athletics department.DUTIES:• Manage the day-to-day practice and skill development of student athletes, practice planning, and recruitment of student athletes. They will also oversee the strength and performance of the team.• Assist with management and administration of Triathlon Team• Assist the head coa... View Details Bookmark Instructor, Lecturer, or Senior Lecturer of Mechanical Engineering F01914P SDSMT-Leslie A. Rose Department of Mechanical Engineering Faculty The Department of Mechanical Engineering at the South Dakota School of Mines & Technology invites applications for fall 2026 and/or spring 2027 semester Instructor, Lecturer, or Senior Lecturer positions. These are part-time, temporary, non-benefited positions and may continue semester-by-semester, dependent upon performance, department need, funding, and student enrollment.Expectations wil... View Details Bookmark Facility Worker CSA02803P USD-Custodial Services CSA USD Facilities Management is hiring for Facility Workers in the Custodial Services department. Duties include, but are not limited to: collect and remove trash; clean and dust furniture, windows, and walls; wet mop, strip and wax floors; vacuum and shampoo carpets; mop and/or buff floors; clean and disinfect bathrooms and restock supplies; room set ups; change light bulbs and clean light fixtur... View Details Bookmark Adjunct Instructor F00778P USD-Counseling & Psychology in Ed. Faculty The Division of Counseling and Psychology in Education invites applications for Adjunct Instructors with expertise in Educational Psychology, Human Development, Counseling, Research Methods, or Statistics for its pool of part-time adjunct instructors. Applications for part-time faculty positions are accepted on a continuous basis and reviewed by the program coordinator when openings become a