    "https://pa-hrsuite-production.s3.amazonaws.com/1225/docs/899.pdf": {
      "title": "Faculty-This includes instructional staff such as Lectureres, Instructors, and Assistant, Associate and Full",
      "description": "Definition of Positions \n \nCivil Service-Civil Service employees are those individuals classified under the Civil Service Act of South \nDakota. This includes, but is not limited to, administrative support staff, computer support, trades, \nchemistry and microbiology, accounting and claims processing, laboratory and medical technicians, and \nagricultural positions. \n \nFaculty-This includes instructional staff such as Lectureres, Instructors, and Assistant, Associate and Full \nProfessors. \n \nNFE (Non-Faculty/Exempt)-This includes all staff members outside of the Civil Service and faculty areas. \nThis predominantly reflects professional, executive and research positions. "
    }
  },
